{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "93", "x": 0.9036148555787364, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03012839302489931, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "be studying coral species,' said Pearce-Kelly. One aim will be to carry out research", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.8265334426659441, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on species to find those that can survive best in warm, acidic waters. Another will", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1436641300790535, "w": 0.8265985460116101, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "be to try to increase coral breeding rates. 'Coral spawn just once a year,' he added.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.16398487055300617, "w": 0.8260772066215126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "'However, aquarium-based research has enabled some corals to spawn artificially,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.18445393154231154, "w": 0.8263890875309868, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "which can assist coral reef restoration efforts. And if this can be extended for all", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.20477467201626426, "w": 0.8264672115457862, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "species, we could consider the launching of coral-spawning programmes several", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22509541249021695, "w": 0.8265002245809113, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "times a year. That would be a big help in restoring blighted reefs.'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24556447347952234, "w": 0.6683889064719185, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "F", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.306118775762768, "w": 0.018223746460710438, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "19", "x": 0.12582140429864574, "y": 0.33697070662277506, "w": 0.027866154287957533, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Research in these fields is being conducted in laboratories around the world, with", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38680843673647186, "w": 0.8267401329728146, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the London Zoo centre linked to this global network. Studies carried out in one", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40712913948903207, "w": 0.8259245469652973, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "centre can then be tested in others. The resulting young coral can then be", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4274498799629847, "w": 0.8260333259412842, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "displayed in the tank in Tiny Giants. 'The crucial point is that the progress we make", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4479189409522901, "w": 0.8263602780189677, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in making coral better able to survive in a warming world can be shown to the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46826442665972995, "w": 0.8258888682813732, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "public and encourage them to believe that we can do something to save the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48858516713368266, "w": 0.8258160755641718, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "planet's reefs,' said Pearce-Kelly. 'Saving our coral reefs is now a critically", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5090542281229881, "w": 0.826257650540209, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "important ecological goal.'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5293749685969408, "w": 0.2758436957867268, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Reading Passage 2 has six sections, A-F.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5898921907513482, "w": 0.427694250697913, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Choose the correct heading for each section from the list of headings below.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6200024624525031, "w": 0.7798583422965775, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "i.", "x": 0.09699657120670743, "y": 0.6965760593789037, "w": 0.016332193102059592, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Tried and tested solutions", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6965760593789037, "w": 0.269594966455373, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ii.", "x": 0.09151380580522946, "y": 0.7247580889376887, "w": 0.02181495850353757, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Cooperation beneath the waves", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7247580889376887, "w": 0.32623679952772905, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "iii.", "x": 0.08607135834183521, "y": 0.7530884390118262, "w": 0.027257405966931807, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Working to lessen the problems", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7530884390118262, "w": 0.32845410670366587, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "iv.", "x": 0.08586978146703572, "y": 0.7814188645287489, "w": 0.027458982841731306, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Disagreement about the accuracy of a certain phrase", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7814188645287489, "w": 0.5441699928324805, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "v.", "x": 0.09131223533823957, "y": 0.8097492146028865, "w": 0.022016528970527457, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Two clear educational goals", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8097492146028865, "w": 0.290356961644287, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "vi.", "x": 0.08586978146703572, "y": 0.8380795646770242, "w": 0.027458982841731306, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Promoting hope", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8380795646770242, "w": 0.16699468244074597, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "vii.", "x": 0.08042733400364148, "y": 0.8664346599846489, "w": 0.03290143030512554, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A warning of further trouble ahead", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8664346599846489, "w": 0.35832039468416316, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}